# Security headers for the Cloudflare Pages site (apex + www only).
# Conservative set — no CSP (would block GTM / the CF analytics beacon / fonts),
# and no HSTS includeSubDomains (must not force HTTPS on other subdomains).
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
